The redesign will keep all operational/security seams binding while changing only evidence fidelity: a compile-time requirement registry will classify every contract obligation, and a generic report state (`reported`, `notReported`, `unsupported`) will replace invented values for the four M3 semantics. Client rekey, bounded I/O, host-before-auth, authentication, direct/exec/upload, cancellation, Keychain references, privacy, and basic keepalive remain ordinary mandatory capabilities.
